WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.390
According to US authorities, the hackers targeted
some of the world's leading corporations.

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:08.570
They breached the networks of technology companies
which remotely manage servers, storage and

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:12.730
other computing tasks and then stole secrets
from their clients.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:17.670
This case is significant because the defendants
are accused of targeting and compromising

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:21.050
managed service providers or MSPs.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:28.439
MSPs are firms that are trusted to store,
process and protect commercial data, including

00:00:28.439 --> 00:00:32.910
intellectual property and other confidential
business information.

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:38.230
When hackers gain access to MSPs they can
steal sensitive business information that

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:42.040
gives competitors an unfair advantage.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:47.329
The attacks were allegedly part of a Chinese
campaign known as cloudhopper, with the defendants

00:00:47.329 --> 00:00:50.860
working on behalf of China's intelligence
service.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:55.840
The managed service providers' networks were
infiltrated multiple times in breaches that

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.450
lasted for weeks and months.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:03.280
The deputy attorney general described it as
part of a trend of state-sponsored hackers

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.519
breaking into US networks.

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:10.880
More than 90 percent of the department's cases
alleging economic espionage over the past

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:13.970
seven years involve China.

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:20.100
More than two thirds of the department's cases
involving thefts of trade secrets are connected

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.140
to China.

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.600
China has rejected the USA's allegations of
industrial espionage . the Foreign Ministry

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:24.600
in Beijing is calling the accusations slanderous.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.340
They also state that the US would also have
to withdraw its charges against two alleged

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:27.340
hackers from China.

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:28.340
This dispute is likely to further burden the
already strained relations between the US

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:28.347
and China due to the trade conflict.

